1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,380
Good evening everyone and thank you for coming to the Soccer Club meeting.

2
00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:08,121
It's good to see so many parents and children here tonight,

3
00:00:08,121 --> 00:00:11,600
and I know you are looking forward to a great football season.

4
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,828
Now I'd like to take a few minutes to tell you about some changes

5
00:00:16,828 --> 00:00:19,120
to the Soccer Club for the coming season.

6
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:23,797
Now, this season we'll be playing all our matches for both the junior

7
00:00:23,797 --> 00:00:28,534
and senior competitions at King's Park, instead of Royal Park,

8
00:00:28,534 --> 00:00:30,220
which was used last season.

9
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:35,054
Now for meetings, we're going to use the clubhouse in King's Park,

10
00:00:35,054 --> 00:00:39,528
and the next meeting will be held in the clubhouse on the 2nd of

11
00:00:39,528 --> 00:00:40,310
July.

12
00:00:40,310 --> 00:00:45,363
As usual, we hope to begin the season with a picnic next Saturday at

13
00:00:45,363 --> 00:00:46,450
the clubhouse.

14
00:00:46,450 --> 00:00:49,960
Please try and come to the picnic as it's always good fun.

15
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:53,389
The last week of the season we usually have a dinner

16
00:00:53,389 --> 00:00:56,277
and presentation of prizes to the players,

17
00:00:56,277 --> 00:01:00,970
and more information about this will be given to you later in the season.

18
00:01:00,970 --> 00:01:03,970
This season we have more teams than ever.

19
00:01:03,970 --> 00:01:08,725
We hope to have ten teams, instead of five, in the junior competition

20
00:01:08,725 --> 00:01:13,380
and they will play on Saturday mornings, beginning at 8.30 a.m.

21
00:01:13,380 --> 00:01:19,647
Training sessions will be held in King's Park on Wednesday afternoons for the juniors

22
00:01:19,647 --> 00:01:22,740
and they will be wearing red shirts again this year.

23
00:01:22,740 --> 00:01:28,351
In the senior competition, there'll be four teams, the same as last year,

24
00:01:28,351 --> 00:01:36,165
and their games will be played on Saturday afternoons starting at 2.30, no sorry,

25
00:01:36,165 --> 00:01:38,810
it will be a 2 o'clock start,

26
00:01:38,810 --> 00:01:44,100
and the training session for seniors is planned for Sunday afternoons.

27
00:01:44,100 --> 00:01:48,584
Now I'd like to introduce you to the new committee for the Soccer Club

28
00:01:48,584 --> 00:01:49,690
for this season.

29
00:01:49,690 --> 00:01:54,508
Firstly, let me welcome Robert Young, the new President,

30
00:01:54,508 --> 00:01:57,560
who will manage the meetings for the next two years.

31
00:01:57,560 --> 00:02:02,162
Robert's son has been playing football with the club for over five years now,

32
00:02:02,162 --> 00:02:06,100
and many thanks to Robert for taking on the job of President.

33
00:02:06,100 --> 00:02:11,225
Next we have Gina Costello, she's the treasurer,

34
00:02:11,225 --> 00:02:14,160
and she will collect the fees from you for the season.

35
00:02:14,160 --> 00:02:18,543
Please try and give Gina your fees as early as possible in the season,

36
00:02:18,543 --> 00:02:21,880
as the club needs the money to buy some new equipment.

37
00:02:21,880 --> 00:02:27,862
Then there's David West who has volunteered to be the club secretary,

38
00:02:27,862 --> 00:02:31,977
and one of the many jobs he will have is to send out newsletters

39
00:02:31,977 --> 00:02:32,860
to you regularly.

40
00:02:32,860 --> 00:02:37,098
If you have any information that may be useful, please let David know

41
00:02:37,098 --> 00:02:40,030
so that it can be included in these newsletters.

42
00:02:40,030 --> 00:02:46,600
Also I'd like to introduce you to Jason Dokic who is the Head Coach.

43
00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:50,454
For all the new members here tonight, this is the third year that Jason

44
00:02:50,454 --> 00:02:52,481
has been with us as Head Coach,

45
00:02:52,481 --> 00:02:55,692
and we are very lucky to have such an experienced coach

46
00:02:55,692 --> 00:02:57,800
and former player at our club.

47
00:02:57,800 --> 00:03:04,260
He will continue to supervise the teams, at training sessions and on match days.

48
00:03:04,260 --> 00:03:10,793
Now before we finish and have some refreshments, does anyone have any questions they'd

49
00:03:10,793 --> 00:03:12,200
like to ask the new committee?
